comments:
Prettier:
```js
a = { // hi
}

b = { // hi
    c: 1 
}
```
to 
```js
a = {
  // hi
};

b = {
  // hi
  c: 1,
};
```

Dart format:
```dart
void main() {
  int a = f(// 1
      );
  int b = f(
      // 2
      );

  int c = g(// 3
      1);
}
```

To use the same syntax nodes across formatters: 

### Prettier

```javascript
a = f(// 1
    );
b = f(
    // 2
    );

c = g(// 3
    1);

// Formatted to

a =
  f(); // 1
b =
  f();
  // 2

c = g(
  // 3
  1,
);
```

### Rust

```rust
let a = f(// 1
);
let b = f(
    // 2
);

c = g(// 3
      1);


// Formatted
let a = f(// 1
);
let b = f(
    // 2
);

let c = g(
    // 3
    1,
);
```

Moves the comment `// 3` to a new line.
